DEMAND LETTER

CASE NO: {caseNumber}

TO: {opposingParty}
FROM: {ourClient}
DATE: {date}

RE: {matterDescription}


Dear Sir/Madam:

Please be advised that we represent {ourClient} in connection with the above-referenced matter.

DEMAND

Based on the facts and circumstances of this matter, our client hereby demands the following:

1. Full payment of damages in the amount of ${amount};
2. Written acknowledgment of responsibility;
3. Cessation of any ongoing harmful conduct.

FACTUAL BACKGROUND

This matter arises from {matterDescription}. Our client has suffered damages as a direct result of your actions or omissions.

LEGAL BASIS

Our client's claims are supported by applicable law and the facts of this case. We are prepared to pursue all available legal remedies if this matter is not resolved satisfactorily.

RESPONSE REQUIRED

Please respond to this demand within thirty (30) days of the date of this letter. Failure to respond may result in the initiation of formal legal proceedings without further notice.

This letter is sent without prejudice to any and all rights and remedies available to our client.

Very truly yours,

_______________________
{lawyerName}
{firmName}

